                  "text": "Found in the scenic surroundings of Sorrento, Spiaggia di San Montano offers a breathtaking view of the sea. Visitors are greeted by a charming environment perfect for unwinding under the warm Italian skies. Spending time here allows for delightful swimming sessions and quiet walks along the coastline. It is best enjoyed during the tranquil morning hours before the midday heat arrives.",
